<title>USA: Boston Properties completes IPO.</title>
<headline>Boston Properties completes IPO.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Properties Inc said Monday it has completed and closed its initial public offering of 31.4 million common shares priced at $25.00 per share.</p>
<p>The over-allotment option of 4.71 million common shares was closed with the initial public offering, bringing the total of all shares sold to the public in connection with the offering to 36.11 million.</p>
<p>The net proceeds from the exercise of the over-allotment option will be used for working capital and other general corporate purposes, including funding current development projects and future acquisitions, Boston Properties said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
